API.md P8, P9, EVALUATION.md §8.1, §8.3: an instance reached as the value of a map entry is
reported at the path `[key]`; with a literal-union key type (`String | "none"`), the key that is
the literal is written as a JSON string (P2 reads a bare `none` as a String), any other word bare.
-- teamboard/slots.canon --
package teamboard

record Slot {
  size: Int

  check fits: size < 10 else "the slot is too big"
}

let slots: {String | "none": Slot} = {
  "none": { size: 12 },
  other: { size: 14 },
}
-- findings.txt --
error[E5001]  teamboard/slots.canon:10:11
  slots["none"]: the slot is too big
  expected by teamboard/slots.canon:6 (check fits)

error[E5001]  teamboard/slots.canon:11:10
  slots[other]: the slot is too big
  expected by teamboard/slots.canon:6 (check fits)

2 errors, 0 warnings in 1 package (…)
